  "The download didn't finish.": "Ni orffennodd y lawrlwythiad.",
  "The exception is Dolby or DTS handed straight to a receiver over HDMI, which Android does where it can — nothing in the app touches that sound, so neither setting has any effect on it. An amplifier doing that has a night mode of its own.": "Yr eithriad yw Dolby neu DTS a anfonir yn syth at dderbynnydd dros HDMI, fel y mae Android yn ei wneud lle gall — nid oes dim yn yr ap yn cyffwrdd â'r sain honno, felly nid oes gan y naill osodiad na'r llall unrhyw effaith arni. Mae gan fwyhadur sy'n gwneud hynny ei fodd nos ei hun.",
  "The film is played as it was mixed.": "Caiff y ffilm ei chwarae fel y cafodd ei chymysgu.",
