  "The other device streams this film from here, so nothing is downloaded twice. Both have to be on the same network, and it has to be switched on for casting under Settings → Network.": "Mae'r ddyfais arall yn cael y ffilm hon oddi yma, felly ni lwythir dim i lawr ddwywaith. Rhaid i'r ddwy fod ar yr un rhwydwaith, ac arni hi rhaid troi darlledu ymlaen o dan Gosodiadau → Rhwydwaith.",
